createdby: DBot
description: |-
  Tier-2+ investigation agent for email security incidents.

  This agent transforms raw email telemetry from XDR email issues (alerts) and
  Microsoft Exchange Online Protection (EOP) and Microsoft Defender for Office 365 (MDO)
  telemetry into a structured, evidence-based investigation narrative.

  It reasons across multiple independent signals to determine:
  - Attacker intent
  - Identity abuse and infrastructure characteristics
  - Email filter and security control bypass indicators
  - User exposure and blast radius

  Optimized for:
  - Business Email Compromise (BEC) and impersonation
  - Credential phishing and OAuth abuse
  - Malware and payload delivery
  - Account takeover (ATO) and lateral abuse
  - Evasion and policy bypass scenarios
